<title>POLAND: INDYKPOL OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>INDYKPOL OCT NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.78 vs   0.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.81 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.07 vs   1.38</p>
<p> Sales		   18.89 vs  12.20</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.91 vs   2.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.26 vs   3.16</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.14 vs   4.73</p>
<p> Sales		  125.06 vs  92.19</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish poultry producer is Olsztynskie</p>
<p>Zaklady Drobiarskie Indykpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
